<title>UK: Ford Brazil sets $200 million Eurbond due 2007.</title>
<headline>Ford Brazil sets $200 million Eurbond due 2007.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers ABN AMRO Hoare Govett and Deutsche Morgan Grenfell.</p>
<p> BORROWER   FORD BRAZIL</p>
<p> AMT    $200 MLN	COUPON     **	  MATURITY    22.JAN.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    22.JAN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.75	REOFFER    **	  SPREAD  **  +280-290</p>
<p> NOTES	**TO BE PRICED</p>
<p>		CALL AND PUT AT YEAR SIX AND EIGHT</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 10	SALE LIMITS US/UK/BR/NL</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   TAX PROVS  STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.375     SELL CONC  0.375     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	SUPPORT AGREEMENT FROM FORD MOTOR CO</p>
<p>	     ISSUED OFF EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
